{"text": "At once. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The tree burst into blossom. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And the boy kissed the Giant. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The other children saw this. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And came running back. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It is your garden now. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Little children said the Giant. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then he took a great axe. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And knocked down the wall. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The children came every day. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But the little boy never came again. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Years later. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> On a winter morning. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The old Giant saw a wonderful tree. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was covered with white blossoms. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And the little boy was standing under it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The Giant saw marks of nails. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> On his hands. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And cried, Who has hurt you. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> These are the wounds of Love. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Said the child. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> You let me play. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In your garden once. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Today you will come with me. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To my garden. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Which is Paradise. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That afternoon. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The children found the Giant. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Under the tree. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Covered with white blossoms.", "alignment": {"characters": ["A", "t", " ", "o", "n", "c", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", "t", "r", "e", "e", " ", "b", "u", "r", "s", "t", " ", "i", "n", "t", "o", " ", "b", "l", "o", "s", "s", "o", "m", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "A", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "b", "o", "y", " ", "k", "i", "s", "s", "e", "d", " ", "t